    "detailed_description": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guide to a slow life</h2></strong><br>In &quot;<i>Grandfather Simulator&quot;</i> you will experience all the delights of a grandfather's measured life. Planning your day begins with an important decision - watch the news or watch your favorite series on TV.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interaction with the outside world</h2></strong><br>You can feel the atmosphere of grandpa's real day, playing with his devoted dog, arguing with his wife about a misplaced slipper or forgotten pills. Be prepared for unpredictable turns!<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Self-care</h2></strong><br>Don't forget about your health! From time to time you will have to take pills to maintain your well-being, and, of course, eat delicious food.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recreation and entertainment</h2></strong><br>Whether you sleep in the evening or doze off in front of the TV is up to you. In &quot;Grandfather Simulator&quot; you can also go for a walk, breathing in fresh virtual air and meeting neighbors.<br><br>Are you ready to become a real grandfather and lead a measured life full of laughter and surprises? Immerse yourself in Grandfather Simulator and test your skills in managing a caring grandfather right now!",
    "about_the_game": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Guide to a slow life</h2></strong><br>In &quot;<i>Grandfather Simulator&quot;</i> you will experience all the delights of a grandfather's measured life. Planning your day begins with an important decision - watch the news or watch your favorite series on TV.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Interaction with the outside world</h2></strong><br>You can feel the atmosphere of grandpa's real day, playing with his devoted dog, arguing with his wife about a misplaced slipper or forgotten pills. Be prepared for unpredictable turns!<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Self-care</h2></strong><br>Don't forget about your health! From time to time you will have to take pills to maintain your well-being, and, of course, eat delicious food.<br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recreation and entertainment</h2></strong><br>Whether you sleep in the evening or doze off in front of the TV is up to you. In &quot;Grandfather Simulator&quot; you can also go for a walk, breathing in fresh virtual air and meeting neighbors.<br><br>Are you ready to become a real grandfather and lead a measured life full of laughter and surprises? Immerse yourself in Grandfather Simulator and test your skills in managing a caring grandfather right now!",
    "short_description": "Open the door to Grandfather's life! Watch TV series, play with the dog, argue with your wife, take pills, eat lunch, sleep, go for a walk. Live the measured life of a grandfather, where every day is an adventure, and routine is an art!",
